summary: Provision a FreeIPA env and run its job recipe
description: |
    Runs on a Testing Farm guest. The plan's prepare step installs the
    BuildRequires of freeipa.spec.in, so when no SRPM URL is supplied the
    test builds freeipa's SRPM directly on the guest from the checked-out
    repo, bakes the preset's channel image from it, and then drives the same
    freeipa-env up/run/down flow a local or ssh queue job would. Exits with
    the run step's status.
test: bash $TMT_TREE/ci/tmt/tests/freeipa-env/tf-runner.sh
duration: 6h
result: custom
